# FUSE mount artifacts. The Cowork device bridge leaves shadow copies of open
# files behind. They are invisible to Quarto but they match every grep-based
# quality gate, so they must never be committed again.
.fuse_hidden*

# The pre-launch punch list, the voice-pass ledger, the style guide and the
# editor prompts. Editorial and course-prep material: it belongs on Kelly's
# machine, not in the repository that serves the site. The live repo should hold
# course content and the tooling needed to publish it, nothing else.
#
# The tools still read these files locally. A fresh clone will not have them, so
# prelaunch.py, voicepass.py and the c10/d-series checks only run where they
# exist.
tasks/2026-planning/prelaunch/

# Quarto writes these beside a .qmd while rendering and does not clean them up.
# One was committed by accident and held 687 lines of build output in the
# repository until 2026-08-25.
*.quarto_ipynb
